            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1085-f2" n="8" xml:id="d1085-f2-content">
                <p>Chu P’ing.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1085-f3" n="9" xml:id="d1085-f3-content">
                <p>Enclosures not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1085-f4" n="10" xml:id="d1085-f4-content">
                <p>Treaty Relinquishing Extraterritorial Rights, signed at Washington, January 11,
